title: "Age-aware HbA1c reliability across NHANES cycles: reproducibility materials"
version: "1.0.1"
date-released: "2026-09-13"
license: "MIT"
authors:
  - family-names: "Malkawi"
    given-names: "Ghassan"
abstract: "Public reproducibility materials for age-aware HbA1c reliability evaluation across NHANES cycles, including source-reconstruction certificates, aggregate repeated out-of-fold and conformal metrics, temporal-transport verification, recovered secondary CQR output checks, and historical ANFIS structural verification. Global residual and age-Mondrian conformal analyses are primary; recovered original CQR is secondary; later fixed-configuration CQR is post hoc exploratory only; historical ANFIS is a structural/reproducibility case only. Participant-level NHANES data are not redistributed. Original code is released under MIT; original documentation, figures, and aggregate derived materials are released under CC BY 4.0 where the applicable rightsholder has authority to grant that license."
keywords:
  - HbA1c
  - NHANES
  - reproducibility
  - conformal prediction
  - temporal transport
